<title>PUERTO RICO: Six dead in Puerto Rico blast.</title>
<headline>Six dead in Puerto Rico blast.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JUAN, Puerto Rico 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six people were killed and 20 were injured early on Thursday in an explosion at a shoe store in the Rio Piedras neighbourhood of San Juan, police said.</p>
<p>Police spokesman Ramon Rodriguez said the cause of the blast was not known. There were unconfirmed reports that work crews had been working on gas lines in the neighbourhood.</p>
